        closings: ("A print on the interior door, a pickup that matches the camera, and a stolen bicycle in {D}'s shed. A hired hauler cannot name the person who hired {D.him}.", "An open door, a scrap job, and a bicycle bought for $40. The State must show {D} was the one who forced that door, and nothing shows that."),
