        defendant: [.direct("Describe what happened when you took your car in.", "\"I'd paid for an extended warranty and brought the car in for a repair that I thought was covered. The advisor said it wasn't.\""), .direct("Why did you stay in the service lane?", "\"I was angry and I wanted someone to listen. I stood there to get the manager's attention.\""), .direct("What did you shout?", "\"That the dealership steals from customers. I regret it now, and I'm sorry for the words.\""), .direct("Did you hear the manager ask you to move?", "\"I heard some of it. The lane was noisy and I was fixed on the advisor.\""), .direct("Why did you record staff?", "\"I wanted proof of how I was treated. I thought I'd need it for a complaint.\""), .direct("What did you do when deputies arrived?", "\"I moved and took the citation. I was embarrassed.\""), .cross("You blocked a service lane for fifteen minutes. Isn't that disruptive?", "\"It was. I lost track of the time.\""), .cross("The manager asked you three times. How could you not hear?", "\"I was angry and the lane was loud. I heard the last one.\""), .cross("You followed the advisor outside. Why?", "\"I wanted an answer. I didn't mean to scare the advisor.\""), .cross("You'd been told to leave and return with a written claim. Why not?", "\"I didn't want to leave without a resolution.\""), .cross("The warranty was denied after review. Isn't the advisor right?", "\"That's what the contract says. I thought the explanation was wrong.\"")],
